THOUGHT: Now let me remove the __new__ method from the TM class to simulate the issue described in the PR:

```bash
# Find the TM class and remove the __new__ method
sed -i '/class TM/,/def __new__/ {
    /def __new__/,/try:/ {
        /def __new__/,/return super().__new__/d
    }
}' ./src/pydicom/valuerep.py
```

